ed}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42879/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e84e45ca-c250-5e65-a04e-4714a485f38e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42879"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "1b50ce1b-bb77-5fac-bfeb-f925f83c29ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "3d2385c4-13a2-5efa-9928-4b9b11badb71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "333beb15-8dd4-58b0-b5cb-6ac68da294e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "2aa28d9f-79cd-5830-9cab-54f693422cff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "e169793d-5814-5cb1-9258-ca8598002033" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7bde7827-1970-51f4-b683-0eaff179440e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-130238/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-130238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-130238/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-130238/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-130238/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130238" :question/id #uuid "995633e5-96ca-5496-ba79-bcf6ece6ec56" :question/math-academy-id "q-130238" :question/problem "Consider the matrices $A$ and $B$ given below. Find $det(A)-det({B}^{T}).$\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1.5 & 7.4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0.4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The determinant of a triangular matrix is equal to the product of the entries on the main diagonal. Therefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}|=(2)\\cdot (-2)\\cdot 1=-4 \\\\ det(B) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1.5 & 7.4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0.4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|=3\\cdot 1\\cdot (-2)=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, $det({B}^{T})=det(B)=-6.$ \n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\ndet(A)-det({B}^{T})=-4-(-6)=2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130238/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e84e45ca-c250-5e65-a04e-4714a485f38e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130238"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130292/selection/845beb42e162b04150b7b438e2c57c85fb9c5dc5bb6c7f2891f90687bf680708" :answer/id #uuid "ed08d8bb-424c-56c8-9f8a-3354e28cc0cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130292/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "47eb2c69-1413-513a-b390-8f44c6607b84" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130292/selection/ebfc0e0786b9e08f32fe2539ae50e791a60b7c4613bb2a0820cefbd3ea742454" :answer/id #uuid "9e2b317f-a